  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Slice capsicums in half lengthways and remove stems and seeds.\n• Place capsicums on a lined oven tray. Brush capsicums with olive oil and season with salt and pepper. Arrange cut-side up and roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63d912dd6e5ae7ecbc0609d9/step-49192d0a.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, roughly chop tomato and pickled jalapenos (if using).\n• Finely chop garlic. Grate carrot.\n• Drain and rinse black beans.\n• In a medium bowl, combine tomato and a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63d912dd6e5ae7ecbc0609d9/step-a5768008.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When capsicums have 5 minutes remaining, in a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook carrot and plant-based bacon bits, tossing, until browned 3-4 minutes.\n• Add black beans, Tex-Mex spice blend, tomato paste and garlic and cook, until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• Stir in the water (for the veggies), brown sugar, 1/2 the butter and 1/2 the vegetable stock pot, cook until slightly thickened, 1-2 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63d912dd6e5ae7ecbc0609d9/step-e926a723.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Remove tray from oven and spoon filling into capsicum.\n• Sprinkle over shredded Cheddar cheese and bake, until cheese is golden, 5-7 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63d912dd6e5ae7ecbc0609d9/step-a3947a9e.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium saucepan, combine the water (for the couscous) and remaining vegetable stock pot.\n• Add couscous and stir to combine. Cover with a lid and remove from heat.\n• Set aside until the water is absorbed, 5 minutes. Fluff up with fork.\n• SPICY! The pickled jalapenos are hot, use less if you're sensitive to heat. Stir through pickled jalapenos and remaining butter.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63d912dd6e5ae7ecbc0609d9/step-4154694d.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide jalapeno couscous and cheesy Mexican stuffed capsicums between plates.\n• Top with zingy tomato and sour cream. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63d912dd6e5ae7ecbc0609d9/step-6b770a19.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
